On an airplane, a "co-pilot" takes over when the captain goes to the bathroom.

Big tech companies have been working since 2000 to create AI. 
Microsoft funded OpenAI to create GPT-3, a language model used to generate complex text from complex queries. OpenAI's <strong>Codex</strong> translates natural language into programming code. GPT-3 (Generative Pre-trained Transformer 3&4) uses large models created using Deep Learning techniques to produce human-link text. Uses for GPT-3:

   * Duolingo uses GPT-3 to correct grammar.
   * Convert descriptions of colors into hex codes
   * Turn comments (natural language) into runnable code
   * Translate one language to others
   * Autofill repetitive code
   * Show alternatives ways to code
   * Explain code (in English)
   * Generate RegEx code when presented with data
